# Growa Qatar - Database Migrations
# Step 0.5: Supabase bootstrap artifacts
#
# MIGRATION DISCIPLINE:
# 1. Every schema change MUST be a migration file
# 2. Naming: YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql
# 3. Never modify migrations that have been applied to staging/production
# 4. Test migrations locally before applying to staging
# 5. Review RLS policies in every migration that creates tables
#
# Migration order will be established in Phase 1:
# - 00001_country_instances.sql
# - 00002_organizations.sql
# - 00003_profiles_memberships.sql
# - 00004_role_templates.sql
# - 00005_invitations.sql
# - 00006_audit_logs.sql
